{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "You win 10% more,\nyou lose 10% less...": "",
  "They make it sound so enticing.\nMaybe I should get in on it.": "",
  "Must be a gambler's heaven.\nMaybe I should get in on it.": "",
  "Hey, where you going?\nDon't you need your money?": "",
  "What the hell is this?\nWho are you?": "",
  "I'm here to get my\nclient's money back.": "",
  "See, you've got some of my client's money.\nAnd I'm here to take it back.": "",
  "Before you lose it on another horse.": "",
  "So they hired a thug to collect.\nShould I be impressed you found me?": "",
  "So they hired a thug to collect?\nShould I be impressed you found me?": "",
  "A thug? Well that's not very nice.\nYou and I are in the same business.": "",
  "I don't know if I'd call myself a thug.\nYou and I are in the same business.": "",
  "You're... a detective?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>You're</font_kind> a... detective?": "",
  "Afraid so. I hear you're pretty hard to get a hold of.\nThat's why the people you owe came to me.": "",
  "Yep. I hear you're pretty hard to get a hold of.\nThat's why the people you owe came to me.": "",
  "Look, I know you have the money on you.": "",
  "You can't get out of this. Just do us both\na favor and pay up. Don't put up a fight.": "",
  "You can't get out of this.\nJust do us both a favor and pay up.": "",
  "Heh... Well, you're right.\nI have the money.": "",
  "But look, I'll pay everything back after\nI win big on this next race! Just wait, okay?": "",
  "But look... I'll pay everything back after I win big\non this next race! Just wait, okay?": "",
  "Are you serious?\nI didn't track you down just so you could—": "",
  "Are you serious? I can't believe you're\nseriously suggesting I—": "",
  "Maybe next time!": "",
  "Kaito-san!\nHe's making a run for it!": "",
  "Kaito-san! He's running!": "",
  "I saw.\nWhere you goin', little guy?": "",
  "I saw. Where you goin', little guy?": "",
  "Damn it, get back here!": "",
  "Fuck off!": "",
  "You need to learn when to quit.": "",
  "Shut up. I have it all figured out.\nI'll get the money!": "",
  "Shut up. I have it all figured out.\nI'll get the damn money!": "",
  "Here. I'll scrounge up\nthe rest for you later.": "",
  "Here, take your pay.\nSorry I don't have it all yet.": "",
  "What about your cut?": "",
  "Where's your cut?": "",
  "I'll get it eventually.\nAll of this goes to the client.": "",
  "The rest of it is for the client.\nI'll get mine eventually.": "",
  "Anyway. I'm gonna swing by Genda-sensei's\nplace, see if he's got any work.": "",
  "Anyway, I'm gonna swing by Genda-sensei's\nplace. See if he's got any work.": "",
  "Don't hold your breath.": "",
  "I mean, you're free to go...\nbut don't get your hopes up.": "",
  "For a lawyer's office,\nthings are slow as shit over there.": "",
  "For a lawyer's office,\nthey're slow as shit, y'know?": "",
  "You're aware they're one\nof our best clients, right?": "",
  "You're aware they're one of our\nbest clients, right?": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. I know you used to work there and all,\nbut don't show up empty-handed.": "",
  "Well... you can't drop by\nan old haunt empty-handed.": "",
  "Here, buy 'em some sweets or something.\nAt least go through the motions.": "",
  "So generous.\nMy boy's all grown up...": "",
  "So generous...\nMy boy's all grown up...": "",
  "Don't mention it, \"dad.\"\nNow get goin'.": "",
  "Don't mention it, \"dad.\"": "",
  "I hear they've got some extra fancy dorayaki at the Poppo\nover on Tenkaichi Street. Even come in a box.": "",
  "How 'bout you check the store on Tenkaichi Street?\nI hear they've got fancy dorayaki. Even comes in a box.": "",
  "...And?": "",
  "Well Genda-sensei's got a pretty\nbig sweet tooth... if you get me.": "",
  "'Cause Genda-sensei... He's got\na pretty big sweet tooth, right?": "",
  "Right. I'll go pick some up.": "",
  "I get it... I'll go pick some up.": "",
  "Kim-san?": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san...": "",
  "You look kinda rattled, man.": "",
  "What's got you so rattled?": "",
  "Don't try to get away, bitch!": "",
  "Don't run, bitch!": "",
  "Crap, they're here!\nSorry, gotta run!": "",
  "Agh, they're here! Sorry, I need to go!": "",
  "Not if we can help it.": "",
  "Who're you guys...?": "",
  "Finally caught him, huh?\nGood work.": "",
  "Ah, finally caught him?": "",
  "Kasai-san!": "",
  "Just drop it already you guys!\nI'll never give her to you!": "",
  "Y-You! Just drop it!\nYou can't have her! I won't let you!": "",
  "C'mon, man. It's damn disgraceful makin'\na babe like her work at a yakiniku joint.": "",
  "C'mon, man. It's damn disgraceful makin'\na babe like that work at a yakiniku joint.": "",
  "That has nothing to do with you!": "",
  "That has... nothing to do with you!": "",
  "Listen, Kim-san.": "",
  "You might not know this, being a foreigner n' all,\nbut we got a saying here...": "",
  "You might not know this since you're a foreigner n' all,\nbut we got a saying here...": "",
  "A hot girl is a terrible thing to waste.": "",
  "A hot girl's a terrible thing to waste.": "",
  "Um... what?": "",
  "Uh, yeah, that's not exactly how it goes.": "",
  "I'm pretty sure that's a \"mind.\"": "",
  "Yeah!?": "",
  "Oh yeah!?": "",
  "Heh. All this over a girl, huh?\nDoesn't reflect too well on you.": "",
  "Heh. \"A hot girl's a terrible thing to waste\"...\nSeriously?": "",
  "Though in this case it looks like that\nreflection's actually kinda accurate.": "",
  "Well, as far as minds go,\nyours sure seems like it was a waste.": "",
  "Mind your fuckin' business!\nWho do you think you are!?": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Mind</font_kind> your own fuckin' business!\nWho do you think you are!?": "",
  "A friend of Kim's. Someone who's not gonna\njust stand by and let you beat him to a pulp.": "",
  "I consider myself this guy's friend. One who's not\ngonna stand by and let you beat him to a pulp.": "",
  "All right, buddy.\nI didn't wanna do this...": "",
  "All right, buddy. I didn't wanna do this...": "",
  "But you were askin' for it, picking a fight\nwith <font_kind=yakuza_italic>the</font_kind> Kenta Kasai of the Keihin Gang.": "",
  "...But you just picked a fight with Kenta Kasai of the Keihin Gang.\nNow you only got yourself to blame.": "",
  "Let's see how smart you really are,\nMr. Know It All!": "",
  "You think you can disrespect me?\nLet's see how smart you really are, Mr. Know It All!": "",
  "He's tougher than he looks...": "",
  "He's tough...": "",
  "Know it all sonuvabitch...": "",
  "Dammit... You goddamn egghead...": "",
  "Now get lost. And I better not\ncatch you near Kim-san again.": "",
  "Now get lost. And remember,\nleave Kim-san alone.": "",
  "I'm not goin' down that quiet.": "",
  "...I'm not goin' down that quiet.": "",
  "You're gonna regret making\nan enemy outta the Keihin!": "",
  "But now, you made an enemy of the Keihin!\nYou're gonna regret this!": "",
  "And don't come back!": "",
  "That's what you say\nwhen you win, dumbass.": "",
  "Idiot. You say that when you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>win</font_kind>.": "",
  "Nobody asked you!": "",
  "You okay, Kim-san?": "",
  "Kim-san? You okay?": "",
  "Yeah...\nThanks for the help, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yeah... Yagami-san, thank you so much.": "",
  "We should probably get out of\nhere before they come back.": "",
  "But... we should get out of here soon.\nThey might come back!": "",
  "Yeah. Good call.": "",
  "I'm so sorry about this, Yagami-san.\nI never meant to drag you into my mess.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'm sorry about this. Honestly,\nI never meant to drag you into my mess.": "",
  "That guy mentioned the Keihin Gang.\nWhat's their deal?": "",
  "It's a group of thugs that have been running wild\nrecently. They have the whole town in a tizzy.": "",
  "They're thugs. They've been running all over\nKamurocho lately.": "",
  "Not even the yakuza know\nhow to deal with them.": "",
  "These days, not even the yakuza\ncan deal with them.": "",
  "Huh. Must really be something, then.": "",
  "That bad, huh.\nMust really be something, then.": "",
  "You've got that right.\nThey're a thorn in this city's side.": "",
  "Yes! They're a thorn in this city's side!": "",
  "One of their leaders, that punk Kasai, won't stop coming for one\nof my employees. I don't want to think about what he wants with her...": "",
  "And one of their leaders is after my waitress!\nThat awful Kasai... I don't want to think of what they'd do!": "",
  "So you were just looking out\nfor your worker.": "",
  "So that's it. You were just looking out\nfor your worker.": "",
  "But of course!\nI am her boss!": "",
  "Well, of course. I'm her boss!": "",
  "But Yagami-san... You really should not have gotten involved.\nNow they will be out for your head too.": "",
  "Yagami-san... You really shouldn't have gotten involved!\nThey'll be out for <font_kind=yakuza_italic>your</font_kind> skin too now.": "",
  "Don't worry.\nI'll be just fine.": "",
  "Nah, don't worry about me.": "",
  "Well, okay. Well now, I will be\nhere if you need anything.": "",
  "...Well, I'm here for you. If you ever get in trouble,\nI'll do what I can!": "",
  "(Phew. Time to go get that gift.)": "",
  "(This'll do. Now to bring it\nto Genda-sensei.)": "",
  "Hold on there, pal.": "",
  "Hey... Hold on there, pal.": "",
  "You just bought some of them dorayaki,\nyeah? Sorry, but they're mine now.": "",
  "What, you think you can just buy that dorayaki?\nSorry, but they're mine now.": "",
  "Uh... Are they?": "",
  "Look, I've been after one of those things for days now...\nand you just bought the last fucking box.": "",
  "Can't stand for that, right, boys?": "",
  "Wow. Can't argue with that logic.": "",
  "What was that, smart ass!?": "",
  "Kengo. You haven't met our\nbuddy Tak here, have you?": "",
  "He's a guy you wanna know.\nHotshot detective type.": "",
  "Hotshot detective type.\nYagami-san's a guy to watch.": "",
  "Right. It's good to meet you!": "",
  "The boss paid his way through law school back\nin the day. Made him into a damn good attorney.": "",
  "Back in the day, the boss paid for law school to\nmake him into a damn good attorney.": "",
  "Guy even managed to get a bonafide\nserial killer off the hook.": "",
  "Seriously!? Wow, that's incredible!": "",
  "Seriously!? That's incredible!": "",
  "Right? Damn shame seeing talent\nlike that go to waste.": "",
  "Totally!": "",
  "Get this, though. The first thing\nthat killer did when he got loose?": "",
  "Get this, though. Once he was free,\nknow what that killer did?": "",
  "Stabbed his girlfriend to death!\nCan you believe that?": "",
  "Stabbed his girlfriend to death\nlike the killer he is!": "",
  "Oh... Damn.": "",
  "That's heavy shit...": "",
  "Yup. Guy got the death penalty and everything.\nThey get around to hanging his ass, Tak?": "",
  "And now, he's on death row.\nJust curious—they get around to hangin' his ass?": "",
  "Not yet, no.": "",
  "...Not yet, no.": "",
  "Well what the hell is taking 'em so long?": "",
  "Would've been done years ago\nif I were in charge. Right?": "",
  "Here. This is the money\nfrom that detective.": "",
  "Oh, here. This is the money\nfrom that detective.": "",
  "The rest is yours.\nI already took my cut.": "",
  "I already took my cut out of it.\nThe rest's yours.": "",
  "Good. You're finally getting the hang\nof this whole debt-collecting thing.": "",
  "Good. Gettin' better at these collection jobs.\nYou're movin' up.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks to you.": "",
  "Thanks to you.": "",
  "Anyway, how's Kaito?": "",
  "Hmph. Anyway, how's Kaito?": "",
  "Fine.": "",
  "You mind asking him something?": "",
  "How long's he gonna stick around? Not wise to stay\nin town after you get kicked outta the family.": "",
  "Is he really still squatting in this town,\neven after we kicked his ass outta the family?": "",
  "But, I can look the other way,\nsince the boss likes you so much.": "",
  "But I can keep lookin' the other way,\nsince the boss likes you so much.": "",
  "Speaking of.\nHow's Matsugane-san doing?": "",
  "Speaking of Matsugane-san.\nHow's he doing?": "",
  "None of your damn business, I'd say.": "",
  "...I'd say that counts as\nfamily business, civvie.": "",
  "C'mon, let's go.": "",
  "(The illustrious Captain Hamura...\nHe's snide as ever.)": "",
  "(Still haven't seen Genda-sensei.\nBetter drop by the office soon.)": "",
  "(Wait, I still need to\ngo see Genda-sensei.)": "",
  "Say Saori-san...\nGot any work lined up for me?": "",
  "Hey, Saori-san...\nGot any work for me?": "",
  "I know you're looking for work, Yagami-san,\nbut asking you for favors feels strange.": "",
  "I can't ask you to do work for me, Yagami-san!\nThat would just feel too strange.": "",
  "So... What are the chances you've\ngot some work for me, Genda-sensei?": "",
  "So... got any work for me,\nGenda-sensei?": "",
  "Work, huh?": "",
  "Work, huh...": "",
  "How long are you gonna keep doing this to yourself,\nYagami? You know how dangerous this city is.": "",
  "I don't like it. Is this detective stuff really what you\nwanna be doing? You know it's a dangerous city.": "",
  "Wouldn't be many cases for me\nif Kamurocho was a safe place.": "",
  "Wouldn't be many cases for me\nif it wasn't.": "",
  "Uh huh. Cases like collecting\ndebt for the yakuza?": "",
  "Cases like collecting debt\nfor the yakuza?": "",
  "Hey, better that than no\nwork at all, am I right?": "",
  "Hey, better that than\nno work at all.": "",
  "You call that detective work?\nYou're practically a mercenary.": "",
  "That doesn't sound like a private eye...\nMore like a mercenary.": "",
  "Fine by me. I was never too hung up\non being a detective anyway.": "",
  "I was never too hung up on\nbeing a detective, anyway.": "",
  "Listen, Yagami.": "",
  "...Hey, Yagami.": "",
  "You ever thought about becoming\na lawyer again?": "",
  "I haven't.": "",
  "And why's that?": "",
  "Take a good look at me, Genda-sensei.": "",
  "...See for yourself.\nLook me in the eyes.": "",
  "These eyes aren't exactly the best judge of character.\nThink I made that clear three years ago.": "",
  "Eyes like these can't see much.\nCan't tell an innocent man from a murderer.": "",
  "What use am I as a lawyer\nif I can't tell good from bad?": "",
  "Knock it off, Yagami.\nStop beating yourself up.": "",
  "It was three years ago.\nYou can't keep beating yourself up over this.": "",
  "What happened to Emi was tragic, yes.\nBut it wasn't your fault.": "",
  "It was... a tragedy, but it didn't happen\nbecause of you. Your job was to defend him.": "",
  "It doesn't matter whose fault it is.\nI never want to deal with something like that again.": "",
  "It doesn't matter whose fault it is.\nI just... don't want it to happen again.": "",
  "So... have any work for me?": "",
  "...So no jobs, Genda-sensei?": "",
  "A guy's gotta stay busy, you know?\nKeeps me distracted from Emi-chan and all that.": "",
  "I can't just sit idle and think about the past.\nMakes me start thinking of Emi-chan, and...": "",
  "It doesn't matter what you've got.\nJust... give me something.": "",
  "Look, give me something.\nI don't care what it is.": "",
  "How about a divorce case?\nI have some evidence that needs collecting.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Maybe next time!": "ไว้คราวหน้านะคะ!",
  "Fuck off!": "ไปตายซะ!",
  "...And?": "...แล้วไง?",
  "Um... what?": "เอ่อ... อะไรนะ?",
  "Yeah!?": "จริงเหรอ!?",
  "Oh yeah!?": "งั้นเหรอ!?",
  "Totally!": "แน่นอน!",
  "Fine.": "ก็ได้",
  "And why's that?": "ทำไมล่ะ?"
 }
}
